 r←Test_HooksResignal dummy;router;req
 ⍝ Without OnErrorFn, the error is still re-signalled, but OnResponseFn sees a 500 first
 router←#.Mocks.NewHookRouter
 req←⎕NEW #.Mocks.MockRequest ('GET' '/broken')
 :Trap 11
     {}router._Dispatch req
     r←0
 :Else
     r←∨/'deliberate error for testing'⍷⎕DMX.Message
 :EndTrap
 r∧←(1=≢#.Mocks.Log)∧(500=(⊃#.Mocks.Log).status)∧(⍬≡(⊃#.Mocks.Log).result)
